msgctxt "64"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Are you okay!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Yeah, I'm fine..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Heh... That's one hell of a man you've got there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Dad!? Why would you do this!? What on earth were you thinking!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Let me apologize for my daughter's frivolous actions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Huh? What are you talking about?"
msgstr "Eh? Di che diavolo parli?"

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"You can stop pretending. I know she asked you to pretend to be her "
"boyfriend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Eh?"

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Heh. I know the way your mind works, young lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "So you knew the whole time..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"I was worried before, but I feel a lot better now that I know that a big, "
"strong guy like you is good enough friends with her to play along with her "
"like this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"If my daughter starts down the wrong path... you'd better do everything in "
"your power to put her back on the right course."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Please watch over for her, in my stead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "I will."
msgstr "Certo."

msgctxt "292"
msgid "I can't believe he knew the whole time..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Heh... No fooling him, I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Still... I never knew how much my dad cared about me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "He sure seems to care a lot about you. He's a good dad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Yeah... You know what, you're right. I'm not going to sit around and worry "
"about myself anymore!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"I made the choice to move to Okinawa, and I'm going to make the most of it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "That's the spirit."
msgstr "È lo spirito giusto."

msgctxt "376"
msgid "But before I do..."
msgstr "Ma prima di farlo..."

msgctxt "388"
msgid "What now?"
msgstr "Che c'è?"

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Well, I have to thank you for all your help, don't I? "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "...Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san... I know you're probably only into younger women, but... would "
"you ever be interested in an old lady like me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "You're hardly an old lady."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"Hehehe! <Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> I'm glad you think so! "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"I feel like I've been waiting for this moment to come forever... "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> So... you know... maybe we could... "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

